{"lean":{"expected":false,"path":null,"via":null,"ref":null},"qa":{"label":"prf:skein-generation","kind":"proof","sidecar":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/skein-generation-proof.qa.json","counts":{"pass":52,"bad":3,"na":17,"other":0,"stale":22},"criteria":[{"id":"trap-closing-aphorism","group":"Voice","result":"pass","severity":null,"notes":"","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:f01","model":null,"at":"2026-08-22","stale":false,"history":2},{"id":"trap-em-dash","group":"Voice","result":"pass","severity":null,"notes":"","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:f01","model":null,"at":"2026-08-22","stale":false,"history":2},{"id":"trap-meta-commentary","group":"Voice","result":"pass","severity":null,"notes":"","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:f01","model":null,"at":"2026-08-22","stale":false,"history":2},{"id":"trap-negation-contrast","group":"Voice","result":"pass","severity":null,"notes":"","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:f01","model":null,"at":"2026-08-22","stale":false,"history":2},{"id":"trap-nonspeakable","group":"Voice","result":"pass","severity":null,"notes":"SS7a VIOLATION, not fixable inline because it is math: the block writes the Skein relation as 'q L_+ - q^{-1} L_- = (q - q^{-1}) L_0'. AGENTS.md 7a fixes the repo convention as L_+ - L_- = (q - q^{-1}) L_0, derived there from the Hecke relation sigma^2 = (q - q^{-1}) sigma + 1 by multiplying through by sigma^{-1} to get sigma - sigma^{-1} = q - q^{-1}, then sending sigma to L_+, sigma^{-1} to L_-, and 1 to L_0. The block's extra q and q^{-1} prefactors are the HOMFLY normalisation (a L_+ - a^{-1} L_- = z L_0), a different relation. reidemeister-mass-invariance.md in this same batch writes the CORRECT form, so the two blocks disagree. PROPOSED: L_+ - L_- = (q - q^{-1}) L_0.","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:f01","model":null,"at":"2026-08-22","stale":false,"history":2},{"id":"trap-performed-warmth","group":"Voice","result":"pass","severity":null,"notes":"","reviewer":"agent","by":"agent:f01","model":null,"at":"2